  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Magic Merch Emporium is a woman-owned, reader-operated small business creating premium bookish merchandise for fans of romantasy and fantasy series. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">About our brand: We design apparel, home goods, accessories, and more inspired by beloved series like ACOTAR, Fourth Wing, and Zodiac Academy - made by readers, for readers. What makes us different: Every design is crafted with deep fandom knowledge and printed on demand for quality and sustainability. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">How affiliates can earn: Promote our products to your bookish audience and earn commission on every sale. How to promote us: Share on BookTok, Bookstagram, or your blog using your unique link. Best for book influencers, BookTokers, and romance/fantasy content creators.</p></div></div>",
